      "title": "How to use",
      "properties": {},
      "widgets_values": [
        "## Image Variations\n\n1. Upload your reference image.\n2. Edit the prompt: say what to keep and what to change.\n3. Run and review Save Image.\n\nThree separate generations use seeds 42, 43 and 44. Save Image saves every result. Increase generation_count for more variations; each image is billed.\n\nThe fixed seed allows unchanged runs to reuse cached outputs. Change the seed or prompt for new results.\n\nNeeds a ModelArk key in Settings > BytePlus."
